  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "“Hidden” is expected to almost completely hide being a member of that group, but it actually reveals membership to friends who belong to the same group. This is inappropriate behavior for “Hidden,” so I feel it should be changed to behave as expected. If this is the intended specification, the label should rename to something more suitable.",
